      "html": "<style>\n@import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Rubik:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap');\n@import url('https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/remixicon@4.9.1/fonts/remixicon.css');\n@layer base {body{background:#090B0F;}}\n@layer components {.ll{font-family:Rubik,sans-serif;color-scheme:dark;color:#F5F7FC;background:#090B0F;scrollbar-width:thin;scrollbar-color:#4B5665 #13161C;} .ll button:focus-visible,.ll input:focus-visible,.ll select:focus-visible,.ll textarea:focus-visible{outline:2px solid #DFFF00;outline-offset:3px;}.ll input::placeholder{color:#B7C1CE;}}\n</style><div data-name=\"LiveLift canonical foundations normal\" class=\"ll h-[1080px] flex flex-col text-[18px] leading-[27px]\" data-kid=\"1\"><div data-name=\"Design reference board\" class=\"p-8 flex-1 overflow-y-auto\" data-kid=\"1-1\"><h2 data-name=\"Heading\" class=\"text-[34px] leading-[1.2] font-medium tracking-[-0.6px]\" data-kid=\"1-1-1\">01 · CANONICAL FOUNDATIONS</h2><p data-name=\"Description\" class=\"text-[16px] leading-6 mt-3 text-[18px] leading-7 text-[#CAD0DA]\" data-kid=\"1-1-2\">Shared visual grammar for every workspace. Lime does the work; evidence distinctions come from explicit labels and provenance.</p><div data-name=\"Region\" class=\"mt-7\" data-kid=\"1-1-3\"><div data-name=\"Region\" class=\"grid grid-cols-2 gap-5\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-1\"><div data-name=\"Typography hierarchy\" class=\"rounded-[12px] bg-[#13161C] p-6\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-1-1\"><h2 data-name=\"Heading\" class=\"text-[28px] leading-[1.2] font-medium tracking-[-0.6px]\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-1-1-1\">Rubik / Operational typography</h2><div data-name=\"Region\" class=\"space-y-4 mt-5\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-1-1-2\"><h2 data-name=\"Heading\" class=\"text-[34px] leading-[1.2] font-medium tracking-[-0.6px]\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-1-1-2-1\">October collection</h2><h2 data-name=\"Heading\" class=\"text-[28px] leading-[1.2] font-medium tracking-[-0.6px]\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-1-1-2-2\">M03 · Cargo Pants</h2><p data-name=\"Description\" class=\"text-[16px] leading-6 text-[18px] font-medium tabular-nums\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-1-1-2-3\">Actual elapsed 05:45 · Target 10 min</p><p data-name=\"Description\" class=\"text-[16px] leading-6 text-[16px] text-[#CAD0DA]\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-1-1-2-4\">Operator reported · Linh · 20:19:04</p><p data-name=\"Description\" class=\"text-[16px] leading-6 text-[18px] leading-7\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-1-1-2-5\">Áo khoác chống nắng nữ dáng rộng có mũ tháo rời</p></div><p data-name=\"Description\" class=\"text-[16px] leading-6 text-[#B7C1CE] mt-5\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-1-1-3\">Titles 28–34 · product / segment 20–28 · actions 18 · body / critical metadata 16 minimum. Codes and clocks use tabular figures.</p></div><div data-name=\"Button hierarchy\" class=\"rounded-[12px] bg-[#13161C] p-6\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-1-2\"><h2 data-name=\"Heading\" class=\"text-[28px] leading-[1.2] font-medium tracking-[-0.6px]\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-1-2-1\">Control hierarchy</h2><div data-name=\"Region\" class=\"flex gap-3 mt-5\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-1-2-2\"><button data-name=\"Start LIVE\" class=\"min-h-[44px] px-4 py-2 rounded-[8px] text-[18px] font-medium inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 whitespace-nowrap bg-[#DFFF00] text-[#111407] hover:bg-[#CBEA00]\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Start LIVE\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-1-2-2-1\"><i data-name=\"Functional play-line icon\" class=\"ri-play-line\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-1-2-2-1-1\"></i>Start LIVE</button><button data-name=\"Choose next\" class=\"min-h-[44px] px-4 py-2 rounded-[8px] text-[18px] font-medium inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 whitespace-nowrap bg-[#292D35] text-[#F5F7FC] hover:bg-[#343944]\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Choose next\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-1-2-2-2\"><i data-name=\"Functional list-check icon\" class=\"ri-list-check\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-1-2-2-2-1\"></i>Choose next</button><button data-name=\"Evidence\" class=\"min-h-[44px] px-2 rounded-[8px] text-[16px] text-[#CAD0DA] hover:text-white inline-flex items-center gap-2\" type=\"button\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-1-2-2-3\"><i data-name=\"Functional information-line icon\" class=\"ri-information-line\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-1-2-2-3-1\"></i>Evidence</button></div><div data-name=\"Region\" class=\"flex gap-3 mt-4\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-1-2-3\"><button data-name=\"Start M03 segment\" class=\"min-h-[44px] px-4 py-2 rounded-[8px] text-[18px] font-medium inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 whitespace-nowrap bg-[#292D35] text-[#F5F7FC] hover:bg-[#343944] opacity-50 cursor-not-allowed\" type=\"button\" disabled aria-disabled=\"true\" aria-label=\"Start M03 segment\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-1-2-3-1\">Start M03 segment</button><button data-name=\"Consequential end action\" class=\"min-h-[44px] px-4 rounded-[8px] text-[18px] text-[#F4A4A4] bg-[#302025]\" type=\"button\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-1-2-3-2\">End tracking</button></div><div data-name=\"Region\" class=\"mt-5\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-1-2-4\"><button data-name=\"Visible keyboard focus\" class=\"min-h-[44px] px-4 rounded-[8px] text-[18px] bg-[#292D35] outline-2 outline-offset-4 outline-[#DFFF00]\" type=\"button\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-1-2-4-1\">Focused action</button></div><p data-name=\"Description\" class=\"text-[16px] leading-6 text-[#B7C1CE] mt-5\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-1-2-5\">One filled lime action. Secondary controls remain high contrast; focus has a 2px outline with 3px offset. Disabled controls keep labels visible.</p></div></div><div data-name=\"Region\" class=\"grid grid-cols-4 gap-4 mt-5\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-2\"><div data-name=\"Surface Canvas → workspace\" class=\"rounded-[12px] bg-[#090B0F] p-5\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-2-1\"><h2 data-name=\"Heading\" class=\"text-[22px] leading-[1.2] font-medium tracking-[-0.6px]\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-2-1-1\">Canvas → workspace</h2><p data-name=\"Description\" class=\"text-[16px] leading-6 text-[#C8CDD6] mt-3\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-2-1-2\">Near-black gutters separate working planes.</p></div><div data-name=\"Surface Operational panel\" class=\"rounded-[12px] bg-[#13161C] p-5\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-2-2\"><h2 data-name=\"Heading\" class=\"text-[22px] leading-[1.2] font-medium tracking-[-0.6px]\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-2-2-1\">Operational panel</h2><p data-name=\"Description\" class=\"text-[16px] leading-6 text-[#C8CDD6] mt-3\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-2-2-2\">NOW anchors actual context. NEXT rises one level.</p></div><div data-name=\"Surface Selected context\" class=\"rounded-[12px] bg-[#252A34] p-5\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-2-3\"><h2 data-name=\"Heading\" class=\"text-[22px] leading-[1.2] font-medium tracking-[-0.6px]\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-2-3-1\">Selected context</h2><p data-name=\"Description\" class=\"text-[16px] leading-6 text-[#C8CDD6] mt-3\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-2-3-2\">Only the current row receives a raised surface.</p></div><div data-name=\"Surface Inspector / popover\" class=\"rounded-[12px] bg-[#303643] p-5\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-2-4\"><h2 data-name=\"Heading\" class=\"text-[22px] leading-[1.2] font-medium tracking-[-0.6px]\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-2-4-1\">Inspector / popover</h2><p data-name=\"Description\" class=\"text-[16px] leading-6 text-[#C8CDD6] mt-3\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-2-4-2\">One shadow permitted for genuinely floating detail.</p></div></div><p data-name=\"Layout rationale\" class=\"text-[16px] leading-6 text-[#AEB7C5] pt-4\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-3\">DESIGN NOTE · Radius: panels12 / rows10 / controls8 / small timeline marks6. Use surface contrast before borders. No status-pill ladder, arbitrary confidence or hover-only actions.</p></div></div></div>",
