      "html": "<style>\n@import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Rubik:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap');\n@import url('https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/remixicon@4.9.1/fonts/remixicon.css');\n@layer base {body{background:#090B0F;}}\n@layer components {.ll{font-family:Rubik,sans-serif;color-scheme:dark;color:#F5F7FC;background:#090B0F;scrollbar-width:thin;scrollbar-color:#4B5665 #13161C;} .ll button:focus-visible,.ll input:focus-visible,.ll select:focus-visible,.ll textarea:focus-visible{outline:2px solid #DFFF00;outline-offset:3px;}.ll input::placeholder{color:#B7C1CE;}}\n</style><div data-name=\"LiveLift canonical semantics normal\" class=\"ll h-[1300px] flex flex-col text-[18px] leading-[27px]\" data-kid=\"1\"><div data-name=\"Design reference board\" class=\"p-8 flex-1 overflow-y-auto\" data-kid=\"1-1\"><h2 data-name=\"Heading\" class=\"text-[34px] leading-[1.2] font-medium tracking-[-0.6px]\" data-kid=\"1-1-1\">01 · Independent semantic dimensions</h2><p data-name=\"Description\" class=\"text-[16px] leading-6 mt-3 text-[18px] leading-7 text-[#CAD0DA]\" data-kid=\"1-1-2\">Text + coherent icon + source + time. Color is secondary. Accepted never implies executed; reported never implies confirmed.</p><div data-name=\"Region\" class=\"mt-7\" data-kid=\"1-1-3\"><div data-name=\"Region\" class=\"grid grid-cols-3 gap-4\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-1\"><div data-name=\"Independent semantic dimension Environment\" class=\"rounded-[12px] bg-[#13161C] p-5\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-1-1\"><h2 data-name=\"Heading\" class=\"text-[22px] leading-[1.2] font-medium tracking-[-0.6px]\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-1-1-1\">Environment</h2><div data-name=\"Region\" class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-x-5 gap-y-3 mt-4\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-1-1-2\"><span data-name=\"REAL status\" class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-[16px] leading-6 text-[#C8CDD6]\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-1-1-2-1\"><i data-name=\"Functional broadcast-line icon\" class=\"ri-broadcast-line\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-1-1-2-1-1\"></i><spa