ss=\"\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-4-1-3-2\">REAL</span></span></div><div data-name=\"Runtime and end control\" class=\"flex gap-5 items-center\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-4-2\"><span data-name=\"Tracking active status\" class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-[16px] leading-6 text-[#DFFF00]\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-4-2-1\"><i data-name=\"Functional record-circle-line icon\" class=\"ri-record-circle-line\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-4-2-1-1\"></i><span data-name=\"Status text\" class=\"\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-4-2-1-2\">Tracking active</span></span><h2 data-name=\"LiveLift elapsed runtime\" class=\"text-[28px] leading-[1.2] font-medium tracking-[-0.6px]\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-4-2-2\">17:45</h2><button data-name=\"Session\" class=\"min-h-[44px] px-2 rounded-[8px] text-[16px] text-[#CAD0DA] hover:text-white inline-flex items-center gap-2\" type=\"button\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-4-2-3\"><i data-name=\"Functional more-line icon\" class=\"ri-more-line\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-4-2-3-1\"></i>Session</button><button data-name=\"End LIVE\" class=\"min-h-[44px] px-4 py-2 rounded-[8px] text-[18px] font-medium inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 whitespace-nowrap bg-[#292D35] text-[#F5F7FC] hover:bg-[#343944]\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"End LIVE\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-4-2-4\">End LIVE</button></div></header><div data-name=\"Operator and room context\" class=\"flex items-center justify-between gap-4 h-[36px] px-6 text-[#B7C1CE] shrink-0\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-5\"><div data-name=\"Operator and room context main\" class=\"min-w-0 flex-1\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-5-1\"><span data-name=\"You are Lead · Linh status\" class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-[16px] leading-6 text-[#C8CDD6]\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-5-1-1\"><i data-name=\"Functional user-settings-line icon\" class=\"ri-user-settings-line\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-5-1-1-1\"></i><span data-name=\"Status text\" class=\"\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-5-1-1-2\">You are Lead · Linh</span></span></div><div data-name=\"Operator and room context actions\" class=\"shrink-0 flex items-center gap-2\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-5-2\"><span data-name=\"@livelift.shop · Room 8412 status\" class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-[16px] leading-6 text-[#C8CDD6]\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-5-2-1\"><i data-name=\"Functional live-line icon\" class=\"ri-live-line\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-5-2-1-1\"></i><span data-name=\"Status text\" class=\"\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-5-2-1-2\">@livelift.shop · Room 8412</span></span></div></div><div data-name=\"Region\" class=\"p-5\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-6\"><p data-name=\"Description\" class=\"text-[16px] leading-6 text-[#B7C1CE]\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-6-1\">Focused desk: no global navigation. Leaving the desk does not stop runtime. End LIVE remains separate from routine actions.</p></div><p data-name=\"Layout rationale\" class=\"text-[16px] leading-6 text-[#AEB7C5] pt-4\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-7\">DESIGN NOTE · Normal shell64px; focused header64px + operator/room line36px. The environment identity is stable; capabilities are independent and scoped to relevant tasks.</p></div></div></div>",
