      "html": "<style>\n@import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Rubik:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap');\n@import url('https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/remixicon@4.9.1/fonts/remixicon.css');\n@layer base {body{background:#090B0F;}}\n@layer components {.ll{font-family:Rubik,sans-serif;color-scheme:dark;color:#F5F7FC;background:#090B0F;scrollbar-width:thin;scrollbar-color:#4B5665 #13161C;} .ll button:focus-visible,.ll input:focus-visible,.ll select:focus-visible,.ll textarea:focus-visible{outline:2px solid #DFFF00;outline-offset:3px;}.ll input::placeholder{color:#B7C1CE;}}\n</style><div data-name=\"LiveLift canonical interactions normal\" class=\"ll h-[1320px] flex flex-col text-[18px] leading-[27px]\" data-kid=\"1\"><div data-name=\"Design reference board\" class=\"p-8 flex-1 overflow-y-auto\" data-kid=\"1-1\"><h2 data-name=\"Heading\" class=\"text-[34px] leading-[1.2] font-medium tracking-[-0.6px]\" data-kid=\"1-1-1\">15 · Interaction / focus / operator safety</h2><p data-name=\"Description\" class=\"text-[16px] leading-6 mt-3 text-[18px] leading-7 text-[#CAD0DA]\" data-kid=\"1-1-2\">Presentational specimens; no production behavior implemented.</p><div data-name=\"Region\" class=\"mt-7\" data-kid=\"1-1-3\"><div data-name=\"Region\" class=\"grid grid-cols-2 gap-5\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-1\"><div data-name=\"Stable decision → execution pattern\" class=\"rounded-[12px] bg-[#13161C] p-5\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-1-1\"><h2 data-name=\"Heading\" class=\"text-[24px] leading-[1.2] font-medium tracking-[-0.6px]\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-1-1-1\">Stable decision → execution</h2><div data-name=\"Region\" class=\"mt-5\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-1-1-2\"><div data-name=\"Region\" class=\"grid grid-cols-2 gap-3\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-1-1-2-1\"><button data-name=\"Accept M03\" class=\"min-h-[44px] px-4 py-2 rounded-[8px] text-[18px] font-medium inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 whitespace-nowrap bg-[#DFFF00] text-[#111407] hover:bg-[#CBEA00]\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Accept M03\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-1-1-2-1-1\">Accept M03</button><button data-name=\"Reject recommendation\" class=\"min-h-[44px] px-4 py-2 rounded-[8px] text-[18px] font-medium inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 whitespace-nowrap bg-[#292D35] text-[#F5F7FC] hover:bg-[#343944]\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Reject recommendation\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-1-1-2-1-2\">Reject recommendation</button></div><div data-name=\"Region\" class=\"grid grid-cols-2 gap-3 mt-2\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-1-1-2-2\"><button data-name=\"Start M03 segment\" class=\"min-h-[44px] px-4 py-2 rounded-[8px] text-[18px] font-medium inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 whitespace-nowrap bg-[#292D35] text-[#F5F7FC] hover:bg-[#343944] opacity-50 cursor-not-allowed\" type=\"button\" disabled aria-disabled=\"true\" aria-label=\"Start M03 segment\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-1-1-2-2-1\">Start M03 segment</button><button data-name=\"Hold proposal\" class=\"min-h-[44px] px-4 py-2 rounded-[8px] text-[18px] font-medium inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 whitespace-nowrap bg-[#292D35] text-[#F5F7FC] hover:bg-[#343944]\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Hold proposal\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-1-1-2-2-2\">Hold proposal</button></div><p data-name=\"Description\" class=\"text-[16px] leading-6 text-[#B7C1CE] mt-3\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-1-1-2-3\">On acceptance the Accept slot remains. Start becomes enabled in its own slot.</p></div></div><div data-name=\"Inline quick capture pattern\" class=\"rounded-[12px] bg-[#13161C] p-5\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-1-2\"><h2 data-name=\"Heading\" class=\"text-[24px] leading-[1.2] font-medium tracking-[-0.6px]\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-1-2-1\">Inline quick capture</h2><div data-name=\"Region\" class=\"mt-5\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-1-2-2\"><label data-name=\"Quick note input\" class=\"block\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-1-2-2-1\"><p data-name=\"Description\" class=\"text-[16px] leading-6 mb-2 font-medium\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-1-2-2-1-1\">Quick note</p><input data-name=\"Quick note field\" aria-label=\"Quick note\" value=\"Sizing questions repeated.\" class=\"w-full h-[48px] bg-[#20252E] border border-[#39414D] rounded-[8px] px-3 text-[18px]\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-1-2-2-1-2\"></label><div data-name=\"Region\" class=\"mt-3 flex gap-3\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-1-2-2-2\"><button data-name=\"Save note\" class=\"min-h-[44px] px-4 py-2 rounded-[8px] text-[18px] font-medium inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 whitespace-nowrap bg-[#292D35] text-[#F5F7FC] hover:bg-[#343944]\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Save note\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-1-2-2-2-1\">Save note</button><button data-name=\"Cancel\" class=\"min-h-[44px] px-2 rounded-[8px] text-[16px] text-[#CAD0DA] hover:text-white inline-flex items-center gap-2\" type=\"button\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-1-2-2-2-2\">Cancel</button></div><p data-name=\"Description\" class=\"text-[16px] leading-6 text-[#B7C1CE] mt-3\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-1-2-2-3\">Enter note intent is useful; the exact shortcut is not assigned yet.</p></div></div><div data-name=\"Contextual report pattern\" class=\"rounded-[12px] bg-[#13161C] p-5\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-1-3\"><h2 data-name=\"Heading\" class=\"text-[24px] leading-[1.2] font-medium tracking-[-0.6px]\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-1-3-1\">Contextual report</h2><div data-name=\"Region\" class=\"mt-5\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-1-3-2\"><div data-name=\"Product recognition\" class=\"flex gap-4 items-center\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-1-3-2-1\"><div data-name=\"Product image unavailable · M03\" class=\"w-[56px] h-[56px] shrink-0 rounded-[10px] bg-[#2A303B] flex flex-col items-center justify-center gap-1\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-1-3-2-1-1\"><span data-name=\"Product initials\" class=\"text-[24px] font-medium text-[#D2D9E4]\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-1-3-2-1-1-1\">CP</span><span data-name=\"Product image fallback code\" class=\"text-[16px] text-[#AFB8C7]\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-1-3-2-1-1-2\">M03</span></div><div data-name=\"Region\" class=\"min-w-0\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-1-3-2-1-2\"><p data-name=\"Product code\" class=\"text-[16px] leading-6 text-[#B7C1CE]\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-1-3-2-1-2-1\">M03</p><h2 data-name=\"Product identity\" class=\"text-[24px] leading-[1.2] font-medium tracking-[-0.6px]\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-1-3-2-1-2-2\">Cargo Pants</h2></div></div><div data-name=\"Region\" class=\"flex gap-3 mt-3\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-1-3-2-2\"><button data-name=\"Attempted\" class=\"min-h-[44px] px-4 py-2 rounded-[8px] text-[18px] font-medium inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 whitespace-nowrap bg-[#292D35] text-[#F5F7FC] hover:bg-[#343944]\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Attempted\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-1-3-2-2-1\">Attempted</button><button data-name=\"I performed this\" class=\"min-h-[44px] px-4 py-2 rounded-[8px] text-[18px] font-medium inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 whitespace-nowrap bg-[#292D35] text-[#F5F7FC] hover:bg-[#343944]\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"I performed this\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-1-3-2-2-2\">I performed this</button></div><p data-name=\"Description\" class=\"text-[16px] leading-6 text-[#B7C1CE] mt-3\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-1-3-2-3\">Product, action, occurrence time and actor remain explicit. A report does not confirm platform state.</p></div></div><div data-name=\"Correction record pattern\" class=\"rounded-[12px] bg-[#13161C] p-5\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-1-4\"><h2 data-name=\"Heading\" class=\"text-[24px] leading-[1.2] font-medium tracking-[-0.6px]\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-1-4-1\">Correction record</h2><div data-name=\"Region\" class=\"mt-5\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-1-4-2\"><div data-name=\"Contextual Original report remains\" class=\"rounded-[12px] bg-[#1B1F27] p-4\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-1-4-2-1\"><div data-name=\"Row\" class=\"flex items-center justify-between gap-4 \" data-kid=\"1-1-3-1-4-2-1-1\"><div data-name=\"Row main\" class=\"min-w-0 flex-1\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-1-4-2-1-1-1\"><span data-name=\"Original report remains status\" class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-[16px] leading-6 text-[#C8CDD6]\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-1-4-2-1-1-1-1\"><i data-name=\"Functional question-line icon\" class=\"ri-question-line\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-1-4-2-1-1-1-1-1\"></i><span data-name=\"Status text\" class=\"\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-1-4-2-1-1-1-1-2\">Original report remains</span></span></div><div data-name=\"Row actions\" class=\"shrink-0 flex items-center gap-2\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-1-4-2-1-1-2\"></div></div><p data-name=\"Description\" class=\"text-[16px] leading-6 text-[#C8CDD6] mt-2\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-1-4-2-1-2\">Add a correction with actor, reason and receipt time. No silent runtime-history undo.</p></div></div></div></div><div data-name=\"Operator efficiency and motion reference\" class=\"rounded-[12px] bg-[#1B1F27] p-6 mt-5\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-2\"><h2 data-name=\"Heading\" class=\"text-[26px] leading-[1.2] font-medium tracking-[-0.6px]\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-2-1\">Keyboard, motion and feedback</h2><p data-name=\"Description\" class=\"text-[16px] leading-6 mt-4 text-[#CAD0DA]\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-2-2\">Shortcut intents: Accept, Reject, Start, Hold/Resume, Extend, Skip, Choose next, Presenting report, Platform report, Note, Return to current, Replay previous/next and evidence disclosure. Exact keys are a Design/usability decision; test OS, browser and input-method conflicts first.</p><p data-name=\"Description\" class=\"text-[16px] leading-6 mt-4 text-[#B7C1CE]\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-2-3\">Tab order: session utilities → NOW details → NEXT evidence → Accept/Reject → Start/Hold → quick capture → runtime actions → ROS → support tabs. Action names include exact targets. Reorder also has Move up / down controls.</p><p data-name=\"Description\" class=\"text-[16px] leading-6 mt-4 text-[#B7C1CE]\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-2-4\">Motion intention: 100–160ms tonal hover, 120ms acceptance acknowledgement, 160–200ms drawer/collapse; no hit-target movement, flashing or pulsing. Reduced motion removes spatial transitions. Use one inline status near an uncertain command; do not stack alert toasts.</p></div><div data-name=\"Recommendation evidence disclosure specimen\" class=\"rounded-[12px] bg-[#1B1F27] p-5 mt-5\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-4\"><h2 data-name=\"Heading\" class=\"text-[24px] leading-[1.2] font-medium tracking-[-0.6px]\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-4-1\">Recommendation reconstruction</h2><div data-name=\"Product recognition\" class=\"flex gap-4 items-center\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-4-2\"><div data-name=\"Product image unavailable · M03\" class=\"w-[56px] h-[56px] shrink-0 rounded-[10px] bg-[#2A303B] flex flex-col items-center justify-center gap-1\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-4-2-1\"><span data-name=\"Product initials\" class=\"text-[24px] font-medium text-[#D2D9E4]\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-4-2-1-1\">CP</span><span data-name=\"Product image fallback code\" class=\"text-[16px] text-[#AFB8C7]\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-4-2-1-2\">M03</span></div><div data-name=\"Region\" class=\"min-w-0\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-4-2-2\"><p data-name=\"Product code\" class=\"text-[16px] leading-6 text-[#B7C1CE]\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-4-2-2-1\">M03</p><h2 data-name=\"Product identity\" class=\"text-[24px] leading-[1.2] font-medium tracking-[-0.6px]\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-4-2-2-2\">Cargo Pants</h2></div></div><p data-name=\"Description\" class=\"text-[16px] leading-6 text-[#CAD0DA] mt-3\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-4-3\">Recorded at 20:17:02 · Pulled ahead of Flash Sale</p><p data-name=\"Description\" class=\"text-[16px] leading-6 text-[#CAD0DA] mt-3\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-4-4\">Inputs at recommendation time: saved plan, operator queue pull-forward and presentation reports. Realtime input unavailable.</p><p data-name=\"Description\" class=\"text-[16px] leading-6 text-[#B7C1CE] mt-3\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-4-5\">Policy version: not captured · Preserved as an evidence gap</p><p data-name=\"Description\" class=\"text-[16px] leading-6 text-[#CAD0DA] mt-3\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-4-6\">Displayed 20:17:03 · Human attention unknown · Decision acknowledged 20:18:04</p><p data-name=\"Description\" class=\"text-[16px] leading-6 text-[#B7C1CE] mt-3\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-4-7\">Decision, attempt, report, provider observation and platform confirmation remain independently expandable. Missing stages stay missing.</p></div><p data-name=\"Layout rationale\" class=\"text-[16px] leading-6 text-[#AEB7C5] pt-4\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-3\">DESIGN NOTE · At 200% zoom, stack primary content into page scroll, preserve labels and controls, and release fixed-height desktop layouts. Below1280 treat operation as a graceful fallback, not a P0 mobile desk.</p></div></div></div>",
      "type": "variant",
      "label": "CANONICAL — APPROVED VISUAL DIRECTION / 15 INTERACTIONS / KEYBOARD / FOCUS · 1600×1320",
