    "node_a34a51bf93f5": {
      "html": "<style>\n@import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Rubik:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap');\n@import url('https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/remixicon@4.9.1/fonts/remixicon.css');\n@layer base {body{background:#090B0F;}}\n@layer components {.ll{font-family:Rubik,sans-serif;color-scheme:dark;color:#F5F7FC;background:#090B0F;scrollbar-width:thin;scrollbar-color:#4B5665 #13161C;} .ll button:focus-visible,.ll input:focus-visible,.ll select:focus-visible,.ll textarea:focus-visible{outline:2px solid #DFFF00;outline-offset:3px;}.ll input::placeholder{color:#B7C1CE;}}\n</style><div data-name=\"LiveLift canonical states normal\" class=\"ll h-[1800px] flex flex-col text-[18px] leading-[27px]\" data-kid=\"1\"><div data-name=\"Design reference board\" class=\"p-8 flex-1 overflow-y-auto\" data-kid=\"1-1\"><h2 data-name=\"Heading\" class=\"text-[34px] leading-[1.2] font-medium tracking-[-0.6px]\" data-kid=\"1-1-1\">15 · Shared empty / loading / degraded / conflict states</h2><p data-name=\"Description\" class=\"text-[16px] leading-6 mt-3 text-[18px] leading-7 text-[#CAD0DA]\" data-kid=\"1-1-2\">Independent dimensions, not a giant success-to-failure ladder.</p><div data-name=\"Region\" class=\"mt-7\" data-kid=\"1-1-3\"><div data-name=\"Region\" class=\"grid grid-cols-3 gap-4\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-1\"><div data-name=\"Loading session reusable state\" class=\"rounded-[12px] bg-[#13161C] p-5\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-1-1\"><span data-name=\"Loading session status\" class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-[16px] leading-6 text-[#C8CDD6]\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-1-1-1\"><i data-name=\"Functional file-list-3-line icon\" class=\"ri-file-list-3-line\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-1-1-1-1\"></i><span data-name=\"Status text\" class=\"\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-1-1-1-2\">Loading session</span></span><p data-name=\"Description\" class=\"text-[16px] leading-6 text-[#CAD0DA] mt-3\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-1-1-2\">Loading authoritative session… Keep identity placeholder; do not show an empty session.</p></div><div data-name=\"Saving / unsaved reusable state\" class=\"rounded-[12px] bg-[#13161C] p-5\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-1-2\"><span data-name=\"Saving / unsaved status\" class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-[16px] leading-6 text-[#C8CDD6]\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-1-2-1\"><i data-name=\"Functional file-list-3-line icon\" class=\"ri-file-list-3-line\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-1-2-1-1\"></i><span data-name=\"Status text\" class=\"\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-1-2-1-2\">Saving / unsaved</span></span><p data-name=\"Description\" class=\"text-[16px] leading-6 text-[#CAD0DA] mt-3\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-1-2-2\">Unsaved changes remain local. Acknowledge exact saved revision before Start.</p></div><div data-name=\"Save failed reusable state\" class=\"rounded-[12px] bg-[#13161C] p-5\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-1-3\"><span data-name=\"Save failed status\" class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-[16px] leading-6 text-[#F4A4A4]\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-1-3-1\"><i data-name=\"Functional file-list-3-line icon\" class=\"ri-file-list-3-line\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-1-3-1-1\"></i><span data-name=\"Status text\" class=\"\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-1-3-1-2\">Save failed</span></span><p data-name=\"Description\" class=\"text-[16px] leading-6 text-[#CAD0DA] mt-3\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-1-3-2\">Your draft is kept. Retry save; do not replace it with a blank plan.</p></div><div data-name=\"Stale revision conflict reusable state\" class=\"rounded-[12px] bg-[#13161C] p-5\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-1-4\"><span data-name=\"Stale revision conflict status\" class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-[16px] leading-6 text-[#C8CDD6]\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-1-4-1\"><i data-name=\"Functional file-list-3-line icon\" class=\"ri-file-list-3-line\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-1-4-1-1\"></i><span data-name=\"Status text\" class=\"\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-1-4-1-2\">Stale revision conflict</span></span><p data-name=\"Description\" class=\"text-[16px] leading-6 text-[#CAD0DA] mt-3\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-1-4-2\">You intended M03. Queue changed to Flash Sale first. Review the change and act again.</p></div><div data-name=\"Creation outcome uncertain reusable state\" class=\"rounded-[12px] bg-[#13161C] p-5\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-1-5\"><span data-name=\"Creation outcome uncertain status\" class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-[16px] leading-6 text-[#C8CDD6]\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-1-5-1\"><i data-name=\"Functional question-line icon\" class=\"ri-question-line\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-1-5-1-1\"></i><span data-name=\"Status text\" class=\"\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-1-5-1-2\">Creation outcome uncertain</span></span><p data-name=\"Description\" class=\"text-[16px] leading-6 text-[#CAD0DA] mt-3\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-1-5-2\">Checking whether a session was created. Avoid duplicate creation until resolved.</p></div><div data-name=\"Offline / reconnecting reusable state\" class=\"rounded-[12px] bg-[#13161C] p-5\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-1-6\"><span data-name=\"Offline / reconnecting status\" class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-[16px] leading-6 text-[#F6C875]\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-1-6-1\"><i data-name=\"Functional error-warning-line icon\" class=\"ri-error-warning-line\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-1-6-1-1\"></i><span data-name=\"Status text\" class=\"\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-1-6-1-2\">Offline / reconnecting</span></span><p data-name=\"Description\" class=\"text-[16px] leading-6 text-[#CAD0DA] mt-3\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-1-6-2\">Snapshot age visible. Start, End, Accept and all runtime transitions disabled.</p></div><div data-name=\"UNSYNCED DRAFT reusable state\" class=\"rounded-[12px] bg-[#13161C] p-5\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-1-7\"><span data-name=\"UNSYNCED DRAFT status\" class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-[16px] leading-6 text-[#C8CDD6]\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-1-7-1\"><i data-name=\"Functional file-list-3-line icon\" class=\"ri-file-list-3-line\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-1-7-1-1\"></i><span data-name=\"Status text\" class=\"\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-1-7-1-2\">UNSYNCED DRAFT</span></span><p data-name=\"Description\" class=\"text-[16px] leading-6 text-[#CAD0DA] mt-3\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-1-7-2\">Saved on this device. Not submitted to session history. Reconnect never auto-submits.</p></div><div data-name=\"Awaiting confirmation reusable state\" class=\"rounded-[12px] bg-[#13161C] p-5\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-1-8\"><span data-name=\"Awaiting confirmation status\" class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-[16px] leading-6 text-[#C8CDD6]\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-1-8-1\"><i data-name=\"Functional file-list-3-line icon\" class=\"ri-file-list-3-line\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-1-8-1-1\"></i><span data-name=\"Status text\" class=\"\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-1-8-1-2\">Awaiting confirmation</span></span><p data-name=\"Description\" class=\"text-[16px] leading-6 text-[#CAD0DA] mt-3\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-1-8-2\">Identity and runtime resynced. Review product, action and occurrence time before submitting.</p></div><div data-name=\"Submission unresolved reusable state\" class=\"rounded-[12px] bg-[#13161C] p-5\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-1-9\"><span data-name=\"Submission unresolved status\" class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-[16px] leading-6 text-[#C8CDD6]\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-1-9-1\"><i data-name=\"Functional question-line icon\" class=\"ri-question-line\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-1-9-1-1\"></i><span data-name=\"Status text\" class=\"\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-1-9-1-2\">Submission unresolved</span></span><p data-name=\"Description\" class=\"text-[16px] leading-6 text-[#CAD0DA] mt-3\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-1-9-2\">Report acknowledgement unknown. Check receipt before retry; draft remains available.</p></div><div data-name=\"Wrong account / room reusable state\" class=\"rounded-[12px] bg-[#13161C] p-5\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-1-10\"><span data-name=\"Wrong account / room status\" class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-[16px] leading-6 text-[#F6C875]\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-1-10-1\"><i data-name=\"Functional error-warning-line icon\" class=\"ri-error-warning-line\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-1-10-1-1\"></i><span data-name=\"Status text\" class=\"\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-1-10-1-2\">Wrong account / room</span></span><p data-name=\"Description\" class=\"text-[16px] leading-6 text-[#CAD0DA] mt-3\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-1-10-2\">Quarantine only the affected provider capability. Expected and observed identities visible.</p></div><div data-name=\"Permission missing / revoked reusable state\" class=\"rounded-[12px] bg-[#13161C] p-5\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-1-11\"><span data-name=\"Permission missing / revoked status\" class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-[16px] leading-6 text-[#C8CDD6]\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-1-11-1\"><i data-name=\"Functional file-list-3-line icon\" class=\"ri-file-list-3-line\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-1-11-1-1\"></i><span data-name=\"Status text\" class=\"\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-1-11-1-2\">Permission missing / revoked</span></span><p data-name=\"Description\" class=\"text-[16px] leading-6 text-[#CAD0DA] mt-3\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-1-11-2\">Affected capabilities unavailable; reconnect with permissions. Manual operation remains available.</p></div><div data-name=\"Provider degraded / stale reusable state\" class=\"rounded-[12px] bg-[#13161C] p-5\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-1-12\"><span data-name=\"Provider degraded / stale status\" class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-[16px] leading-6 text-[#F6C875]\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-1-12-1\"><i data-name=\"Functional error-warning-line icon\" class=\"ri-error-warning-line\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-1-12-1-1\"></i><span data-name=\"Status text\" class=\"\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-1-12-1-2\">Provider degraded / stale</span></span><p data-name=\"Description\" class=\"text-[16px] leading-6 text-[#CAD0DA] mt-3\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-1-12-2\">Show per-capability availability, last receipt and age. Preserve manual operation.</p></div><div data-name=\"Unknown verification reusable state\" class=\"rounded-[12px] bg-[#13161C] p-5\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-1-13\"><span data-name=\"Unknown verification status\" class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-[16px] leading-6 text-[#C8CDD6]\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-1-13-1\"><i data-name=\"Functional question-line icon\" class=\"ri-question-line\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-1-13-1-1\"></i><span data-name=\"Status text\" class=\"\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-1-13-1-2\">Unknown verification</span></span><p data-name=\"Description\" class=\"text-[16px] leading-6 text-[#CAD0DA] mt-3\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-1-13-2\">No confirmation received. Operator report remains a report. Unknown is not failed.</p></div><div data-name=\"Partial metrics reusable state\" class=\"rounded-[12px] bg-[#13161C] p-5\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-1-14\"><span data-name=\"Partial metrics status\" class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-[16px] leading-6 text-[#C8CDD6]\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-1-14-1\"><i data-name=\"Functional file-list-3-line icon\" class=\"ri-file-list-3-line\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-1-14-1-1\"></i><span data-name=\"Status text\" class=\"\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-1-14-1-2\">Partial metrics</span></span><p data-name=\"Description\" class=\"text-[16px] leading-6 text-[#CAD0DA] mt-3\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-1-14-2\">Missing intervals are gaps. Show source, definition, window, as-of and finality.</p></div><div data-name=\"Late evidence reusable state\" class=\"rounded-[12px] bg-[#13161C] p-5\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-1-15\"><span data-name=\"Late evidence status\" class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-[16px] leading-6 text-[#C8B2FF]\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-1-15-1\"><i data-name=\"Functional file-list-3-line icon\" class=\"ri-file-list-3-line\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-1-15-1-1\"></i><span data-name=\"Status text\" class=\"\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-1-15-1-2\">Late evidence</span></span><p data-name=\"Description\" class=\"text-[16px] leading-6 text-[#CAD0DA] mt-3\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-1-15-2\">With later evidence lens: event time20:19:06 / receipt21:02:10. As-known excludes it.</p></div><div data-name=\"Conflicting reports reusable state\" class=\"rounded-[12px] bg-[#13161C] p-5\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-1-16\"><span data-name=\"Conflicting reports status\" class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-[16px] leading-6 text-[#C8CDD6]\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-1-16-1\"><i data-name=\"Functional file-list-3-line icon\" class=\"ri-file-list-3-line\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-1-16-1-1\"></i><span data-name=\"Status text\" class=\"\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-1-16-1-2\">Conflicting reports</span></span><p data-name=\"Description\" class=\"text-[16px] leading-6 text-[#CAD0DA] mt-3\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-1-16-2\">Retain both attributed records. Do not pick a winning assertion without evidence.</p></div><div data-name=\"Abandoned / ended session reusable state\" class=\"rounded-[12px] bg-[#13161C] p-5\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-1-17\"><span data-name=\"Abandoned / ended session status\" class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-[16px] leading-6 text-[#C8CDD6]\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-1-17-1\"><i data-name=\"Functional file-list-3-line icon\" class=\"ri-file-list-3-line\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-1-17-1-1\"></i><span data-name=\"Status text\" class=\"\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-1-17-1-2\">Abandoned / ended session</span></span><p data-name=\"Description\" class=\"text-[16px] leading-6 text-[#CAD0DA] mt-3\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-1-17-2\">Lifecycle determines contextual action. Ended runtime controls remain disabled.</p></div><div data-name=\"Empty product / session / evidence reusable state\" class=\"rounded-[12px] bg-[#13161C] p-5\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-1-18\"><span data-name=\"Empty product / session / evidence status\" class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-[16px] leading-6 text-[#C8CDD6]\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-1-18-1\"><i data-name=\"Functional file-list-3-line icon\" class=\"ri-file-list-3-line\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-1-18-1-1\"></i><span data-name=\"Status text\" class=\"\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-1-18-1-2\">Empty product / session / evidence</span></span><p data-name=\"Description\" class=\"text-[16px] leading-6 text-[#CAD0DA] mt-3\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-1-18-2\">Small functional icon, exact explanation and one relevant action. No huge illustration.</p></div></div><p data-name=\"Layout rationale\" class=\"text-[16px] leading-6 text-[#AEB7C5] pt-4\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-2\">DESIGN NOTE · Representative specimens are shared across workspaces. Unknown, unavailable, missing and failed remain visibly and verbally distinct. Routine notifications are acknowledgements; unresolved truth remains attached to the relevant record.</p></div></div></div>",
