    "node_0cd59c916a7e": {
      "html": "<style>\n@import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Rubik:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap');\n@import url('https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/remixicon@4.9.1/fonts/remixicon.css');\n@layer base {body{background:#090B0F;}}\n@layer components {.ll{font-family:Rubik,sans-serif;color-scheme:dark;color:#F5F7FC;background:#090B0F;scrollbar-width:thin;scrollbar-color:#4B5665 #13161C;} .ll button:focus-visible,.ll input:focus-visible,.ll select:focus-visible,.ll textarea:focus-visible{outline:2px solid #DFFF00;outline-offset:3px;}.ll input::placeholder{color:#B7C1CE;}}\n</style><div data-name=\"LiveLift canonical responsive normal\" class=\"ll h-[1100px] flex flex-col text-[18px] leading-[27px]\" data-kid=\"1\"><div data-name=\"Design reference board\" class=\"p-8 flex-1 overflow-y-auto\" data-kid=\"1-1\"><h2 data-name=\"Heading\" class=\"text-[34px] leading-[1.2] font-medium tracking-[-0.6px]\" data-kid=\"1-1-1\">14 · Responsive priority and scroll ownership</h2><p data-name=\"Description\" class=\"text-[16px] leading-6 mt-3 text-[18px] leading-7 text-[#CAD0DA]\" data-kid=\"1-1-2\">Breakpoints preserve task order. Added width reveals useful rows, not extra cards.</p><div data-name=\"Region\" class=\"mt-7\" data-kid=\"1-1-3\"><div data-name=\"Responsive behavior reference\" class=\"rounded-[12px] bg-[#13161C] p-6\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-1\"><div data-name=\"Prepare responsive rules\" class=\"flex items-center justify-between gap-4 py-5 border-b border-[#303744]\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-1-1\"><div data-name=\"Prepare responsive rules main\" class=\"min-w-0 flex-1\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-1-1-1\"><h2 data-name=\"Heading\" class=\"text-[21px] leading-[1.2] font-medium tracking-[-0.6px]\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-1-1-1-1\">Prepare</h2></div><div data-name=\"Prepare responsive rules actions\" class=\"shrink-0 flex items-center gap-2\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-1-1-2\"><div data-name=\"Region\" class=\"w-[850px]\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-1-1-2-1\"><p data-name=\"Description\" class=\"text-[16px] leading-6 \" data-kid=\"1-1-3-1-1-2-1-1\">320 / dominantROS / 290 readiness</p><p data-name=\"Description\" class=\"text-[16px] leading-6 text-[#CAD0DA] mt-2\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-1-1-2-1-2\">310 / ROS · bottom action</p><p data-name=\"Description\" class=\"text-[16px] leading-6 text-[#B7C1CE] mt-2\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-1-1-2-1-3\">Cap1680 · more list visibility</p></div></div></div><div data-name=\"Operate responsive rules\" class=\"flex items-center justify-between gap-4 py-5 border-b border-[#303744]\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-1-2\"><div data-name=\"Operate responsive rules main\" class=\"min-w-0 flex-1\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-1-2-1\"><h2 data-name=\"Heading\" class=\"text-[21px] leading-[1.2] font-medium tracking-[-0.6px]\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-1-2-1-1\">Operate</h2></div><div data-name=\"Operate responsive rules actions\" class=\"shrink-0 flex items-center gap-2\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-1-2-2\"><div data-name=\"Region\" class=\"w-[850px]\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-1-2-2-1\"><p data-name=\"Description\" class=\"text-[16px] leading-6 \" data-kid=\"1-1-3-1-2-2-1-1\">40%NOW / 60%NEXT · ROS + one support</p><p data-name=\"Description\" class=\"text-[16px] leading-6 text-[#CAD0DA] mt-2\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-1-2-2-1-2\">360px commandband ·44px toolbar · ROSowns scroll</p><p data-name=\"Description\" class=\"text-[16px] leading-6 text-[#B7C1CE] mt-2\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-1-2-2-1-3\">Cap1680 · more ROSrows; no extra widgets</p></div></div></div><div data-name=\"Review responsive rules\" class=\"flex items-center justify-between gap-4 py-5 border-b border-[#303744]\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-1-3\"><div data-name=\"Review responsive rules main\" class=\"min-w-0 flex-1\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-1-3-1\"><h2 data-name=\"Heading\" class=\"text-[21px] leading-[1.2] font-medium tracking-[-0.6px]\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-1-3-1-1\">Review</h2></div><div data-name=\"Review responsive rules actions\" class=\"shrink-0 flex items-center gap-2\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-1-3-2\"><div data-name=\"Region\" class=\"w-[850px]\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-1-3-2-1\"><p data-name=\"Description\" class=\"text-[16px] leading-6 \" data-kid=\"1-1-3-1-3-2-1-1\">215nav / eventledger / 340inspector</p><p data-name=\"Description\" class=\"text-[16px] leading-6 text-[#CAD0DA] mt-2\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-1-3-2-1-2\">215nav / eventledger · inspectordrawer</p><p data-name=\"Description\" class=\"text-[16px] leading-6 text-[#B7C1CE] mt-2\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-1-3-2-1-3\">Cap1760 · readable time rail and deeper lists</p></div></div></div><div data-name=\"Home / Sessions responsive rules\" class=\"flex items-center justify-between gap-4 py-5 border-b border-[#303744]\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-1-4\"><div data-name=\"Home / Sessions responsive rules main\" class=\"min-w-0 flex-1\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-1-4-1\"><h2 data-name=\"Heading\" class=\"text-[21px] leading-[1.2] font-medium tracking-[-0.6px]\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-1-4-1-1\">Home / Sessions</h2></div><div data-name=\"Home / Sessions responsive rules actions\" class=\"shrink-0 flex items-center gap-2\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-1-4-2\"><div data-name=\"Region\" class=\"w-[850px]\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-1-4-2-1\"><p data-name=\"Description\" class=\"text-[16px] leading-6 \" data-kid=\"1-1-3-1-4-2-1-1\">Max1160 /1240 · normal page scroll</p><p data-name=\"Description\" class=\"text-[16px] leading-6 text-[#CAD0DA] mt-2\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-1-4-2-1-2\">Supporting tasks wrap; primary action stays first</p><p data-name=\"Description\" class=\"text-[16px] leading-6 text-[#B7C1CE] mt-2\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-1-4-2-1-3\">Centered, not endlessly stretched</p></div></div></div><div data-name=\"Products / Create / Wrap responsive rules\" class=\"flex items-center justify-between gap-4 py-5 border-b border-[#303744]\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-1-5\"><div data-name=\"Products / Create / Wrap responsive rules main\" class=\"min-w-0 flex-1\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-1-5-1\"><h2 data-name=\"Heading\" class=\"text-[21px] leading-[1.2] font-medium tracking-[-0.6px]\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-1-5-1-1\">Products / Create / Wrap</h2></div><div data-name=\"Products / Create / Wrap responsive rules actions\" class=\"shrink-0 flex items-center gap-2\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-1-5-2\"><div data-name=\"Region\" class=\"w-[850px]\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-1-5-2-1\"><p data-name=\"Description\" class=\"text-[16px] leading-6 \" data-kid=\"1-1-3-1-5-2-1-1\">Product recognition grid; focused forms</p><p data-name=\"Description\" class=\"text-[16px] leading-6 text-[#CAD0DA] mt-2\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-1-5-2-1-2\">Two library columns; contextual drawer if needed</p><p data-name=\"Description\" class=\"text-[16px] leading-6 text-[#B7C1CE] mt-2\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-1-5-2-1-3\">Cap1260 /900 /920</p></div></div></div><div data-name=\"Short height / zoom responsive rules\" class=\"flex items-center justify-between gap-4 py-5 border-b border-[#303744]\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-1-6\"><div data-name=\"Short height / zoom responsive rules main\" class=\"min-w-0 flex-1\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-1-6-1\"><h2 data-name=\"Heading\" class=\"text-[21px] leading-[1.2] font-medium tracking-[-0.6px]\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-1-6-1-1\">Short height / zoom</h2></div><div data-name=\"Short height / zoom responsive rules actions\" class=\"shrink-0 flex items-center gap-2\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-1-6-2\"><div data-name=\"Region\" class=\"w-[850px]\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-1-6-2-1\"><p data-name=\"Description\" class=\"text-[16px] leading-6 \" data-kid=\"1-1-3-1-6-2-1-1\">No tiny metadata or automatic hit-target relocation</p><p data-name=\"Description\" class=\"text-[16px] leading-6 text-[#CAD0DA] mt-2\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-1-6-2-1-2\">Collapse Pulse,History,expanded evidence first</p><p data-name=\"Description\" class=\"text-[16px] leading-6 text-[#B7C1CE] mt-2\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-1-6-2-1-3\">200% zoom releases fixed heights and uses page scroll</p></div></div></div></div><p data-name=\"Layout rationale\" class=\"text-[16px] leading-6 text-[#AEB7C5] pt-4\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-2\">DESIGN NOTE · Actual canonical core frames are provided at1280×720,1440×900,1600×1000 and1920×1080. Workspaces have explicit local scroll ownership, no scroll containers inside rows. Simple pages keep normal page scroll.</p></div></div></div>",
